playstyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mn>98</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>98</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>So, the direct variation equation is given by\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"37\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D454 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Finally, substituting the value of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"38\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D454 TEX-I\"></mjx-